//app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1m9elx9be/47c0d4ea-3ab2-4e74-9b64-3c7cb772d984/0fb60ca0-17d4-11f0-aa90-fb8fb1646899/file-jaoe38c1m9elx9bf.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;max-height: 40vh;vertical-align: baseline\" alt=\"JEE Main 2025 (Online) 7th April Evening Shift Chemistry - Basics of Organic Chemistry Question 10 English 3\"></p>\n<p>(D) $ \\mathrm{CH}_3 \\mathrm{NH}_2$</p>\n<p>(E) $\\left(\\mathrm{CH}_3\\right)_2 \\mathrm{NH}$</p>\n<p>Choose the <b>correct</b> answer from the options given below :</p>", "options": ["<p>E &gt; A &gt; D &gt; C &gt; B</p>", "<p>E &gt; D &gt; A &gt; B &gt; C</p>", "<p>E &gt; D &gt; B &gt; A &gt; C</p>", "<p>B &gt; E &gt; D &gt; A &gt; C</p>"], "correctOptionIndex": 0, "explanation": "Detailed solution not available."}, {"id": "jee_12601", "exam": "JEE Main", "subject": "Chemistry", "chapter": "basics-of-organic-chemistry", "year": 2025, "difficulty": "Moderate", "questionText": "<p>The number of optically active products obtained from the complete ozonolysis of the given compound is :</p>\n\n<img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/@width/image/jaoe38c1m9ema1ez/ef2c6b8e-494e-46ad-a7c8-cd08865dbb15/732087b0-17d5-11f0-aa90-fb8fb1646899/file-jaoe38c1m9ema1f0.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1m9ema1ez/ef2c6b8e-494e-46ad-a7c8-cd08865dbb15/732087b0-17d5-11f0-aa90-fb8fb1646899/file-jaoe38c1m9ema1f0.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;max-height: 40vh;vertical-align: baseline\" alt=\"JEE Main 2025 (Online) 7th April Evening Shift Chemistry - Basics of Organic Chemistry Question 9 English\">", "options": ["<p>4</p>", "<p>0</p>", "<p>2</p>", "<p>1</p>"], "correctOptionIndex": 0, "explanation": "Detailed solution not available."}, {"id": "jee_12602", "exam": "JEE Main", "subject": "Chemistry", "chapter": "basics-of-organic-chemistry", "year": 2025, "difficulty": "